<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About - Bikesceeme</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('./partials/_navbar') %>

    <section class="about-hero-section">
        <div class="about-hero-content">
            <h1>About Bikesceeme: Passion for Every Ride</h1>
            <p>At Bikesceeme, we believe cycling is more than just a sport or a commute; it's a lifestyle, a journey, and a profound connection to the world around us. Our mission is to empower every rider with the perfect bike that embodies quality, innovation, and passion.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story-section section-padding">
        <div class="story-content">
            <h2>Our Story: Crafting Journeys Since Day One</h2>
            <p>Bikesceeme began with a simple idea: to make exceptional cycling accessible to everyone. Founded by a team of avid cyclists and engineers, our journey started in a small workshop with a big dream – to design bikes that inspire adventure, foster health, and promote sustainable living.</p>
            <p>Over the years, we've grown, but our core dedication to craftsmanship and rider satisfaction remains unwavering. Every bike we create is a testament to our commitment to excellence, combining cutting-edge technology with timeless design principles.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-image">
            <img src="/images/tony-pham-8gzO8C65Gcg-unsplash.jpg" alt="Bikesceeme Workshop" />
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-mission-values section-padding">
        <h2>Our Mission & Values</h2>
        <div class="mission-values-container">
            <div class="value-card">
                <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                <p>To provide cyclists worldwide with high-performance, durable, and aesthetically pleasing bikes that enhance their riding experience and contribute to a healthier planet.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card">
                <h3>Our Vision</h3>
                <p>To be the leading innovator in the cycling industry, inspiring more people to embrace cycling as a primary mode of transport and recreation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card">
                <h3>Our Core Values</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Quality:</strong> Uncompromising standards in every component.</li>
                    <li><strong>Innovation:</strong> Continuously pushing the boundaries of bike design.</li>
                    <li><strong>Sustainability:</strong> Committed to eco-friendly practices.</li>
                    <li><strong>Community:</strong> Fostering a global community of passionate riders.</li>
                    <li><strong>Integrity:</strong> Operating with transparency and honesty.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-team-section section-padding">
        <h2>Meet Our Team</h2>
        <p>Behind every Bikesceeme creation is a dedicated team of experts – from seasoned engineers and designers to passionate cyclists and customer support specialists. We are united by a shared love for bikes and a commitment to delivering unparalleled quality and service.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-cta-section section-padding text-center">
        <h2>Ready to Ride Your Story?</h2>
        <p>Explore our diverse range of bikes and find the perfect companion for your next adventure.</p>
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-cta">View All Bikes</a>
    </section>

    <%- include('./partials/_footer') %>
</body>
</html>
